9900						;
9901						; OSBYTE 2 (&02) Specify input stream
9902						;
9903						; Input may be taken from either the keyboard (by default) or the
9904						; RS423 port. This call specifies the selection for all subsequent
9905						; input.
9906						;
9907						; Entry parameters :
9908						; X=0 selects keyboard input and disables RS423
9909						; X=1 selects and enables RS423 input
9910						; X=2 selects keyboard input and enables RS423
9911						; Y=0
9912						;
9913						; On exit : X=0 indicates previous input was from the keyboard
9914						;           X=1 indicates previous input was from RS423
9915						;           Y is undefined
